    "id": "half_marathon_training_walkers",
    "name": "Half Marathon Training: Walkers",
    "author": "Hal Higdon",
    "version": "1.0",
    "created_at": null,
    "description": "MOST MAJOR HALF MARATHONS ARE FOR RUNNERS-but walkers can do them too. One advantage of a half marathon over a full marathon is that you won't need to spend as much time on the course. Most reasonably fit individuals should be able to walk 13.1 miles in around four hours. Doing so is fun. It ... Continue reading \"Walkers\"",
